{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30637","headline":"随州献李侍御二首 一 · 姚鹄","name":"随州献李侍御二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"彩笔曾专造化权，道尊翻向宦途闲。\n端居有地唯栽药，静坐无时不忆山。\n德望旧悬霄汉外，政声新溢路歧间。\n衆知圣主搜贤相，朝夕欲徴黄霸还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚鹄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30637.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30637","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}